00:59:04,615 --> 00:59:10,615
The Legion is a 2020 Spanish-American action adventure film directed by
Jose Magan, and featuring Mickey Rourke and Bai Ling.

9
01:06:27,692 --> 01:06:33,692
It is based on the war between Rome and Parthian
Empire in Armenia from 58 to 63 AD.

10
01:13:50,769 --> 01:13:56,769
The Legion blends historical drama with action-adventure,
capturing a small but intense moment of ancient warfare.

11
